thoughts-container"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-content ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-wrapper"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c2166473866="" class="ng-tns-c2166473866-27 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c2166473866-27 is-mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c2166473866-27"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c2166473866-27 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c2166473866-27"><span _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="ng-tns-c2166473866-27">显示思路</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c2166473866-27"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c2166473866-27 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3024867895="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" _nghost-ng-c4114227185="" id="message-content-id-r_1636f1181fff2c62" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4114227185="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_1636f1181fff2c62" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0"><code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="0">RedisTemplate</code> 的默认配置使用的是 <b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="24">JDK 序列化 (JdkSerializationRedisSerializer)</b>。这会导致 Redis 中的数据看起来像乱码（二进制流），不仅难以阅读，而且无法跨语言交互。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">通常我们希望：</p><ul data-path-to-node="2"><li><p data-path-to-node="2,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Key</b> 使用 <b data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="7">String</b> 格式（方便阅读和查找）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Value</b> 使用 <b data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="9">JSON</b> 格式（方便对象存储和解析）。</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="3">以下是配置 <code data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="6">RedisTemplate</code> 序列化规则的标准方案。</p><hr data-path-to-node="4"><h3 data-path-to-node="5">1. 标准配置代码 (Spring Boot)</h3><p data-path-to-node="6">你需要在 Spring Boot 项目中创建一个配置类，重新定义 <code data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="33">redisTemplate</code> 的 Bean。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-38 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-38 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_1636f1181fff2c62&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_1b05201002c45945&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahcKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQZQ" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-38 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-38">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-38 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-38 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_1636f1181fff2c62&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_1b05201002c45945&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-38"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-38"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-38"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-38"><span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.context.annotation.Bean;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.context.annotation.Configuration;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.data.redis.connection.RedisConnectionFactory;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.data.redis.core.RedisTemplate;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.data.redis.serializer.GenericJackson2JsonRedisSerializer;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.data.redis.serializer.StringRedisSerializer;

<span class="hljs-meta">@Configuration</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title">RedisConfig</span> </span>{

    <span class="hljs-meta">@Bean</span>
    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> RedisTemplate&lt;String, Object&gt; <span class="hljs-title">redisTemplate</span><span class="hljs-params">(RedisConnectionFactory factory)</span> </span>{
        RedisTemplate&lt;String, Object&gt; template = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> RedisTemplate&lt;&gt;();
        template.setConnectionFactory(factory);

        <span class="hljs-comment">// 1. 创建序列化器</span>
        <span class="hljs-comment">// Key 的序列化器：直接转换为 String</span>
        StringRedisSerializer stringSerializer = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> StringRedisSerializer();
        <span class="hljs-comment">// Value 的序列化器：使用 Jackson 转换为 JSON</span>
        GenericJackson2JsonRedisSerializer jsonSerializer = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> GenericJackson2JsonRedisSerializer();

        <span class="hljs-comment">// 2. 设置 Key 的序列化规则</span>
        template.setKeySerializer(stringSerializer); <span class="hljs-comment">// 普通 Key</span>
        template.setHashKeySerializer(stringSerializer); <span class="hljs-comment">// Hash 结构的 Key (field)</span>

        <span class="hljs-comment">// 3. 设置 Value 的序列化规则</span>
        template.setValueSerializer(jsonSerializer); <span class="hljs-comment">// 普通 Value</span>
        template.setHashValueSerializer(jsonSerializer); <span class="hljs-comment">// Hash 结构的 Value</span>

        <span class="hljs-comment">// 4. 初始化参数</span>
        template.afterPropertiesSet();
        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> template;
    }
}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 data-path-to-node="8">2. 常用序列化器对比</h3><p data-path-to-node="9">在配置中，你主要会用到以下几种序列化器：</p><div class="horizontal-scroll-wrapper"><div class="table-block-component"><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><table-block _nghost-ng-c3726268734="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" class="table-block has-export-button has-scrollbar"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" not-end-of-paragraph="" class="table-content not-end-of-paragraph" jslog="275421;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQ3ecQahcKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQZg"><table data-path-to-node="10"><thead><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="10,0,0,0">序列化器类名</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="10,0,1,0">存储格式 (Redis中)</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="10,0,2,0">优点</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="10,0,3,0">缺点</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="10,0,4,0">适用场景</span></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="10,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="10,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">JdkSerializationRedisSerializer</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="10,1,1,0"><code data-path-to-node="10,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">\xac\xed\x00\x05sr...</code> (二进制)</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="10,1,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="10,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">默认配置</b>，支持任何实现 Serializable 接口的对象。</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="10,1,3,0">无法阅读，体积大，只能被 Java 读取。</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="10,1,4,0">不推荐，除非完全不关心可读性。</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="10,2,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="10,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">StringRedisSerializer</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="10,2,1,0"><code data-path-to-node="10,2,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">user:1001</code> (纯文本)</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="10,2,2,0">简单、可读性极强。</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="10,2,3,0">只能存字符串。如果存对象，需要手动转 JSON。</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="10,2,4,0"><b data-path-to-node="10,2,4,0" data-index-in-node="0">Key 的首选</b>。</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="10,3,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="10,3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">GenericJackson2JsonRedisSerializer</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="10,3,1,0"><code data-path-to-node="10,3,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">{"@class":"com.example.User", "id":1}</code></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="10,3,2,0">自动转 JSON，且<b data-path-to-node="10,3,2,0" data-index-in-node="10">包含类信息</b>，反序列化时自动转回原对象。</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="10,3,3,0">包含 <code data-path-to-node="10,3,3,0" data-index-in-node="3">@class</code> 字段，占用稍多空间；跨语言需要处理该字段。</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="10,3,4,0"><b data-path-to-node="10,3,4,0" data-index-in-node="0">Value 的通用首选</b>。</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="10,4,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="10,4,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Jackson2JsonRedisSerializer</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="10,4,1,0"><code data-path-to-node="10,4,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">{"id":1}</code></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="10,4,2,0">纯净 JSON，不带类信息。</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="10,4,3,0">反序列化时必须指定具体的 <code data-path-to-node="10,4,3,0" data-index-in-node="13">Class</code> 类型，不够灵活。</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="10,4,4,0">需要极简 JSON 存储时。</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" hide-from-message-actions="" class="table-footer hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制表格" aria-label="复制表格" data-test-id="copy-table-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="276666;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_1636f1181fff2c62&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,null,null,null,0]]"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-l google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----></table-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></div></div><h3 data-path-to-node="11">3. 特殊情况：StringRedisTemplate</h3><p data-path-to-node="12">如果你的 Key 和 Value <b data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="17">全部都是字符串</b>，你根本不需要配置 <code data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="34">RedisTemplate</code>。Spring Boot 默认提供了一个 <code data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="68">StringRedisTemplate</code>，它已经默认将 Key 和 Value 都配置成了 String 序列化。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-39 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c228316134