<span class="hljs-string">"gemini"</span>     -&gt; 使用 hashValueSerializer (建议 JSON)
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><blockquote data-path-to-node="11"><p data-path-to-node="11,0"><b data-path-to-node="11,0" data-index-in-node="0">注意：</b> 如果你没有显式配置 <code data-path-to-node="11,0" data-index-in-node="14">hashKeySerializer</code> 和 <code data-path-to-node="11,0" data-index-in-node="34">hashValueSerializer</code>，它们默认会使用 <code data-path-to-node="11,0" data-index-in-node="62">defaultSerializer</code> (通常是 JDK 序列化)，这会导致你的 Hash 字段和值在 Redis Desktop Manager 里看起来是乱码。</p></blockquote><h4 data-path-to-node="12">(2) List / Set 结构</h4><p data-path-to-node="13">这两个结构比较简单，只有 Key 和 内部元素。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-57 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-57 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_18ef6459a589c014&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_97cfeeca189d770f&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQhAE" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-57 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-57">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-57 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-57 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_18ef6459a589c014&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_97cfeeca189d770f&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-57"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-57"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-57"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-57"><span class="hljs-comment">// 代码：opsForList().rightPush("task:list", myTaskObject);</span>

