myTaskObject  -&gt; 使用 valueSerializer (注意：这里不用 HashValueSerializer)
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h4 data-path-to-node="15">(3) ZSet (有序集合)</h4><p data-path-to-node="16">ZSet 由 <b data-path-to-node="16" data-index-in-node="7">Member (成员)</b> 和 <b data-path-to-node="16" data-index-in-node="21">Score (分数)</b> 组成。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-58 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-58 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_18ef6459a589c014&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_97cfeeca189d770f&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQhQE" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-58 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-58">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-58 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-58 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_18ef6459a589c014&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_97cfeeca189d770f&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-58"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-58"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-58"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-58"><span class="hljs-comment">// 代码：opsForZSet().add("ranking:2024", userObject, 100.0);</span>

<span class="hljs-string">"ranking:2024"</span> -&gt; 使用 keySerializer
userObject     -&gt; 使用 valueSerializer (作为成员存储)
<span class="hljs-number">100.0</span>          -&gt; 它是 Double 类型，Redis 内部直接作为数字处理，不涉及序列化器。
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><hr data-path-to-node="18"><h3 data-path-to-node="19">3. 如何配置（完整版）</h3><p data-path-to-node="20">为了避免踩坑（比如 Hash 的 key 变成了乱码），建议总是<b data-path-to-node="20" data-index-in-node="32">显式设置全部 4 个序列化器</b>。</p><p data-path-to-node="21">即使你觉得 Hash 的 Key 和 Value 应该和普通的 Key/Value 一样，也要把代码写全，指向同一个序列化器对象：</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-59 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-59 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_18ef6459a589c014&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_97cfeeca189d770f&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQhgE" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-59 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-59">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-59 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-59 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_18ef6459a589c014&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_97cfeeca189d770f&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-59"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-59"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-59"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-59"><span class="hljs-meta">@Bean</span>
<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> RedisTemplate&lt;String, Object&gt; <span class="hljs-title">redisTemplate</span><span class="hljs-params">(RedisConnectionFactory factory)</span> </span>{
    RedisTemplate&lt;String, Object&gt; template = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> RedisTemplate&lt;&gt;();
    template.setConnectionFactory(factory);

    <span class="hljs-comment">// 定义两种序列化器</span>
    StringRedisSerializer stringSerializer = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> StringRedisSerializer();
    GenericJackson2JsonRedisSerializer jsonSerializer = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> GenericJackson2JsonRedisSerializer();

    <span class="hljs-comment">// 1. 设置 顶层 Key</span>
    template.setKeySerializer(stringSerializer);

    <span class="hljs-comment">// 2. 设置 普通 Value (适用于 String, List, Set, ZSet)</span>
    template.setValueSerializer(jsonSerializer);

    <span class="hljs-comment">// 3. 设置 Hash 结构的 Field (重点！很容易漏掉)</span>
    template.setHashKeySerializer(stringSerializer); 

    <span class="hljs-comment">// 4. 设置 Hash 结构的 Value (重点！)</span>
    template.setHashValueSerializer(jsonSerializer);

    template.afterPropertiesSet();
    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> template;
}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 data-path-to-node="23">总结</h3><ul data-path-to-node="24"><li><p data-path-to-node="24,0,0">存 <b data-path-to-node="24,0,0" data-index-in-node="2">List / Set / ZSet</b> 时：用的是 <code data-path-to-node="24,0,0" data-index-in-node="26">setValueSerializer</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="24,1,0">存 <b data-path-to-node="24,1,0" data-index-in-node="2">Hash</b> 时：用的是 <code data-path-to-node="24,1,0" data-index-in-node="13">setHashKeySerializer</code> (字段名) 和 <code data-path-to-node="24,1,0" data-index-in-node="42">setHashValueSerializer</code> (字段值)。</p></li></ul><hr data-path-to-node="25"><p data-path-to-node="26"><b data-path-to-node="26" data-index-in-node="0">建议的下一步</b></p><p data-path-to-node="27">你现在已经掌握了序列化配置。在实际开发中，<b data-path-to-node="27" data-index-in-node="21">Hash 结构</b>非常适合存储对象（例如把 User 对象打散存储），但也容易产生<b data-path-to-node="27" data-index-in-node="60">数据更新不一致</b>的问题。</p><p data-path-to-node="28">你需要我介绍 <b data-path-to-node="28" data-index-in-node="7">“什么时候该用 String 存 JSON 对象，什么时候该用 Hash 结构存对象”</b> 的选型对比吗？</p></div><!----></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="response-footer is-mobile gap has-thoughts complete"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" _nghost-ng-c1438932748="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _n