 的序列化器确实更“安全”，能规避很多反序列化爆炸的问题，但代价是代码写起来麻烦一点。</b></p><p data-path-to-node="2">下面我为你详细分析这两种方案的优劣，以及如何解决“对象属性变更”导致的问题。</p><hr data-path-to-node="3"><h3 data-path-to-node="4">方案一：使用 StringRedisSerializer (手动转 JSON)</h3><p data-path-to-node="5">这种方案的核心思想是：<b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="11">Redis 只管存字符串，对象转 JSON 的过程由开发者自己在业务代码中控制。</b></p><h4 data-path-to-node="6">配置方式</h4><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-75 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-75 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_86fce230f3f33b3c&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_11d77326ab1b29b4&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQpwE" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-75 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-75">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-75 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-75 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_86fce230f3f33b3c&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_11d77326ab1b29b4&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-75"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-75"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-75"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-75">template.setValueSerializer(<span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> StringRedisSerializer());
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h4 data-path-to-node="8">这种方式的优点</h4><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="9"><li><p data-path-to-node="9,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="9,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">完全掌控反序列化过程：</b> 当你从 Redis 取出字符串后，你可以用 <code data-path-to-node="9,0,0" data-index-in-node="34">try-catch</code> 包裹 <code data-path-to-node="9,0,0" data-index-in-node="47">JSON.parseObject()</code>。如果对象结构变了导致解析失败，你可以捕获异常，决定是返回 <code data-path-to-node="9,0,0" data-index-in-node="95">null</code> 还是默认值，而不会导致整个请求在 Redis 层直接抛出异常崩溃。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="9,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">没有 <code data-path-to-node="9,1,0" data-index-in-node="3">@class</code> 依赖：</b> 数据里只有纯净的 JSON，不包含 Java 类名。即使你重构代码修改了类名，或者把数据给 Python/Go 读取，都没有问题。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="9,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">调试方便：</b> 在 Redis 客户端里看到的就是标准的 JSON 字符串，极其直观。</p></li></ol><h4 data-path-to-node="10">这种方式的缺点</h4><ul data-path-to-node="11"><li><p data-path-to-node="11,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="11,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">代码繁琐：</b> 每次存数据都要手动 <code data-path-to-node="11,0,0" data-index-in-node="16">JSON.toJSONString(obj)</code>，取数据都要手动 <code data-path-to-node="11,0,0" data-index-in-node="47">JSON.parseObject(str, User.class)</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="11,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="11,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">丧失了 Spring Data 的便捷性：</b> 不能直接利用 <code data-path-to-node="11,1,0" data-index-in-node="29">@Cacheable</code> 这种基于自动序列化的注解（除非自定义 CacheManager）。</p></li></ul><hr data-path-to-node="12"><h3 data-path-to-node="13">方案二：使用 JSON Serializer (自动转 JSON)</h3><p data-path-to-node="14">这是 Spring Boot 的主流用法，但确实存在你担心的<b data-path-to-node="14" data-index-in-node="30">反序列化失败</b>风险。</p><h4 data-path-to-node="15">风险场景复现</h4><p data-path-to-node="16">假设你用 <code data-path-to-node="16" data-index-in-node="5">GenericJackson2JsonRedisSerializer</code> 存了一个对象：</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-76 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-76 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_86fce230f3f33b3c&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_11d77326ab1b29b4&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQqAE" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-76 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-76">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-76 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-76 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_86fce230f3f33b3c&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_11d77326ab1b29b4&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c22831