1,1,1,2" data-index-in-node="14">null</code>。</p></td><td><span data-path-to-node="21,1,2,0">无需处理。</span></td></tr><tr><td><p data-path-to-node="21,2,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="21,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">减少字段</b></p><br data-path-to-node="21,2,0,1"><p data-path-to-node="21,2,0,2">(Java类删了 <code data-path-to-node="21,2,0,2" data-index-in-node="9">age</code>，但Redis里还有)</p></td><td><p data-path-to-node="21,2,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="21,2,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">危险 (可能报错)</b>。</p><br data-path-to-node="21,2,1,1"><p data-path-to-node="21,2,1,2">Jackson 发现 JSON 里有 <code data-path-to-node="21,2,1,2" data-index-in-node="19">age</code> 但 Java 类里没有，会抛 <code data-path-to-node="21,2,1,2" data-index-in-node="38">UnrecognizedPropertyException</code>。</p></td><td><span data-path-to-node="21,2,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="21,2,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">关键配置</b>：设置 <code data-path-to-node="21,2,2,0" data-index-in-node="8">FAIL_ON_UNKNOWN_PROPERTIES</code> 为 <code data-path-to-node="21,2,2,0" data-index-in-node="37">false</code>。</span></td></tr><tr><td><p data-path-to-node="21,3,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="21,3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">修改类名/包名</b></p><br data-path-to-node="21,3,0,1"><p data-path-to-node="21,3,0,2">(<code data-path-to-node="21,3,0,2" data-index-in-node="1">User</code> 改名为 <code data-path-to-node="21,3,0,2" data-index-in-node="10">Member</code>)</p></td><td><p data-path-to-node="21,3,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="21,3,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">崩溃</b>。</p><br data-path-to-node="21,3,1,1"><p data-path-to-node="21,3,1,2">Redis 里的 <code data-path-to-node="21,3,1,2" data-index-in-node="9">@class</code> 找不到对应的类，直接抛 <code data-path-to-node="21,3,1,2" data-index-in-node="28">ClassNotFoundException</code>。</p></td><td><span data-path-to-node="21,3,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="21,3,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">无解</b>。必须清空缓存或写脚本清洗数据。</span></td></tr><tr><td><p data-path-to-node="21,4,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="21,4,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">修改字段类型</b></p><br data-path-to-node="21,4,0,1"><p data-path-to-node="21,4,0,2">(<code data-path-to-node="21,4,0,2" data-index-in-node="1">age</code> 从 <code data-path-to-node="21,4,0,2" data-index-in-node="7">int</code> 变为 <code data-path-to-node="21,4,0,2" data-index-in-node="14">String</code>)</p></td><td><p data-path-to-node="21,4,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="21,4,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">崩溃</b>。</p><br data-path-to-node="21,4,1,1"><p data-path-to-node="21,4,1,2">类型转换异常。</p></td><td><span data-path-to-node="21,4,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="21,4,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">无解</b>。通常需要更换 Key 的版本号。</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" hide-from-message-actions="" class="table-footer hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制表格" aria-label="复制表格" data-test-id="copy-table-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="276666;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_86fce230f3f33b3c&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,null,null,null,0]]"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-l google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----></table-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></div></div><hr data-path-to-node="22"><h3 data-path-to-node="23">最佳实践建议</h3><p data-path-to-node="24">如果你担心“对象属性变更”导致生产环境事故，建议采取以下 <b data-path-to-node="24" data-index-in-node="29">“混合防御”</b> 策略：</p><h4 data-path-to-node="25">1. 推荐配置：自定义 ObjectMapper 的 JSON 序列化器</h4><p data-path-to-node="26">不要直接用默认的，而是要<b data-path-to-node="26" data-index-in-node="12">自定义 ObjectMapper</b>，显式关闭“未知属性报错”。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-78 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-78 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_86fce230f3f33b3c&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_11d77326ab1b29b4&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQrAE" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-78 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-78">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-78 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-78 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_86fce230f3f33b3c&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_11d77326ab1b29b4&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-78"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-78"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-78"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-78"><span class="hljs-meta">@Bean</span>
<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> RedisTemplate&lt;String, Object&gt; <span class="hljs-title">redisTemplate</span><span class="hljs-params">(RedisConnectionFactory factory)</span> </span>{
    RedisTemplate&lt;String, Object&gt; template = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> RedisTemplate&lt;&gt;();
    template.setConnectionFactory(factory);

    StringRedisSerializer stringSerializer = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> StringRedisSerializer();

    <span class="hljs-comment">// 1. 定义 ObjectMapper</span>
    ObjectMapper om = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> ObjectMapper();
    <span class="hljs-comment">// 【关键】：遇到未知属性（比如Redis里有旧字段，Java类删掉了）不报错</span>
    om.configure(DeserializationFeature.FAIL_ON_UNKNOWN_PROPERTIES, <span class="hljs-keyword">false</span>);
    
    <span class="hljs-comment">// (可选) 开启类型信息存储，支持多态，但会有 @class 耦合风险</span>
    <span class="hljs-comment">// om.activateDefaultTyping(LaissezFaireSubTypeValidator.instance, ObjectMapper.DefaultTyping.NON_FINAL);</span>

    <span class="hljs-comment">// 2. 使用 GenericJackson2JsonRedisSerializer 并传入配置好的 ObjectMapper</span>
    <span class="hljs-comment">// 注意：Spring Data Redis 不同版本这里构造函数可能不同，通常使用 Jackson2JsonRedisSerializer 更灵活</span>
    Jackson2JsonRedisSerializer&lt;Object&gt; jacksonSerializer = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> Jackson2JsonRedisSerializer&lt;&gt;(Object.class);
    jacksonSerializer.setObjectMapper(om);

    template.setKeySerializer(stringSerializer);
    template.setValueSerializer(jacksonSerializer); <span class="hljs-comment">// 使用配置了容错的序列化器</span>
    template.setHashKeySerializer(stringSerializer);
    template.setHashValueSerializer(jacksonSerializer);

    template.afterPropertiesSet();
    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> template;
}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h4 data-path-to-node="28">2. 进阶策略：关于 @class 的取舍</h4><ul data-path-to-node="29"><li><p data-path-to-node="29,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="29,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">如果你的系统非常稳定，且依赖 <code data-path-to-node="29,0,0" data-index-in-node="15">@Cacheable</code> 注解：</b> 使用带有 <code data-path-to-node="29,0,0" data-index-in-node="35">@class</code> 信息的 <code data-path-to-node="29,0,0" data-index-in-node="46">GenericJackson2JsonRedisSerializer</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="29,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="29,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">如果你经常重构代码（改类名），或者有多语言读取需求：</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="29,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="29,1,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="29,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">强烈建议使用 <code data-path-to-node="29,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="7">StringRedisSerializer</code> 作为 Value 序列化器。</b></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="29,1,1,1,0">在 Service 层封装一个 <code data-path-to-node="29,1,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="16">RedisService</code> 工具类，内部统一做 <code data-path-to-node="29,1,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="39">toJson</code> 和 <code data-path-to-node="29,1,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="48">fromJson</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="29,1,1,2,0">虽然麻烦一点，但这是保证数据<b data-path-to-node="29,1,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="14">长期兼容性</b>最稳妥的办法。</p></li></ul></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node="30">总结</h3><ul data-path-to-node="31"><li><p data-path-to-node="31,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="31,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">StringSerializer</b>：最稳，兼容性最好，但用起来麻烦（需要手动转对象）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="31,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="31,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">JsonSerializer</b>：开发最快。</p><ul data-path-to-node="31,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="31,1,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="31,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">必做配置：</b> <code data-path-to-node="31,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="6">FAIL_ON_UNKNOWN_PROPERTIES = false</code> (防止删字段报错)。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="31,1,1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="31,1,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">死穴：</b> 不能改类名/包名（如果存了 <code data-path-to-node="31,1,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="18">@class</code>）。</p></li></ul></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="32"><b data-path-to-node="32" data-index-in-node="0">我的建议是：</b> 如果是核心业务数据，且业务逻辑变动频繁，<b data-path-to-node="32" data-index-in-node="27">用 StringSerializer 配合手动 JSON 转换</b>。虽然多写两行代码，但睡得安稳。</p></div><!----></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="response-footer is-mobile has-thoughts gap complete"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" _nghost-ng-c1438932748="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3454274491="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c3454274491-60"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c1927598164="" class="ng-tns-c1927598164-68 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c1927598164-68 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" class="spacer ng-tns-c1927598164-68 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c1927598164-68"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c1927598164-68"><!----></mat-menu><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><