nimation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">答案是：<b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="4">直接将 Java 对象传入即可，不需要手动转换成 JSON 字符串。</b></p><p data-path-to-node="1"><code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="0">RedisTemplate</code> 的设计初衷就是为了帮你把这些“脏活累活”（序列化/反序列化）自动化处理掉。</p><p data-path-to-node="2">以下是详细的对比和原理解析：</p><h3 data-path-to-node="3">1. 正确的做法：直接存对象</h3><p data-path-to-node="4">当你配置了 <code data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="6">Jackson2JsonRedisSerializer</code> 后，<code data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="36">RedisTemplate</code> 会在内部拦截你的 <code data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="59">set</code> 请求，自动调用 Jackson 把对象转成 JSON，然后存入 Redis。</p><p data-path-to-node="5"><b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="0">代码示例：</b></p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-114 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-114 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_90dba5fef281d7ea&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_b2abf18db01ed6d8&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ0wE" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-114 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-114">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-114 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-114 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_90dba5fef281d7ea&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_b2abf18db01ed6d8&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-114"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-114"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-114"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-114"><span class="hljs-meta">@Autowired</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">private</span> RedisTemplate&lt;String, Object&gt; redisTemplate; <span class="hljs-comment">// 注意泛型是 Object</span>

<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">void</span> <span class="hljs-title">saveUser</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span> </span>{
    User user = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> User(<span class="hljs-string">"Gemini"</span>, <span class="hljs-number">18</span>);
    
    <span class="hljs-comment">// 【正确】直接传入 user 对象</span>
    <span class="hljs-comment">// RedisTemplate 会自动调用 Jackson2JsonRedisSerializer 将其转为 JSON</span>
    redisTemplate.opsForValue().set(<span class="hljs-string">"user:1001"</span>, user);
}
