 data-mat-icon-name="more_vert"></mat-icon><span class="mdc-button__label"></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="response-content ng-tns-c3454274491-148"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-container"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-content ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-wrapper"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c2166473866="" class="ng-tns-c2166473866-150 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c2166473866-150 is-mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c2166473866-150"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c2166473866-150 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c2166473866-150"><span _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="ng-tns-c2166473866-150">显示思路</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c2166473866-150"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c2166473866-150 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3024867895="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" _nghost-ng-c4114227185="" id="message-content-id-r_6c52e688b3af9d80" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4114227185="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_6c52e688b3af9d80" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">这是一个非常敏锐的问题！通常我们引入第三方中间件时，都需要单独配置一大堆参数，但在 Redisson 这里确实显得有点“神奇”。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">简短的回答是：<b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="7">在大多数基础场景下，你确实不需要专门配置 Redisson 的连接信息。</b></p><p data-path-to-node="2">这是因为你引入的依赖 <code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="11">redisson-spring-boot-starter</code> 做了大量的自动适配工作。</p><p data-path-to-node="3">以下是详细的<b data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="6">原理揭秘</b>和<b data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="11">例外情况</b>：</p><h3 data-path-to-node="4">1. 为什么不需要？(自动配置的魔法)</h3><p data-path-to-node="5">当你引入 <code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="5">redisson-spring-boot-starter</code> 后，Redisson 会在启动时自动读取 Spring Boot 原生的 Redis 配置（即 <code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="82">spring.data.redis.*</code>）。</p><p data-path-to-node="6"><b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="0">它会做一个自动映射：</b></p><div class="horizontal-scroll-wrapper"><div class="table-block-component"><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><table-block _nghost-ng-c3726268734="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" class="table-block has-export-button"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" not-end-of-paragraph="" class="table-content not-end-of-paragraph" jslog="275421;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQ3ecQahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQmgI"><table data-path-to-node="7"><thead><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="7,0,0,0">Spring Boot 配置 (<code data-path-to-node="7,0,0,0" data-index-in-node="16">application.yml</code>)</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="7,0,1,0">Redisson 内部行为</span></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="7,1,0,0"><code data-path-to-node="7,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">spring.data.redis.host</code></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="7,1,1,0">自动填入 Redisson 的地址配置</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="7,2,0,0"><code data-path-to-node="7,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">spring.data.redis.port</code></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="7,2,1,0">自动填入 Redisson 的端口配置</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="7,3,0,0"><code data-path-to-node="7,3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">spring.data.redis.password</code></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="7,3,1,0">自动填入 Redisson 的密码配置</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="7,4,0,0"><code data-path-to-node="7,4,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">spring.data.redis.database</code></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="7,4,1,0">自动填入 Redisson 的库索引</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="7,5,0,0"><code data-path-to-node="7,5,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">spring.data.redis.ssl</code></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="7,5,1,0">自动开启 Redisson 的 SSL 模式</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" hide-from-message-actions="" class="table-footer hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制表格" aria-label="复制表格" data-test-id="copy-table-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="276666;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6c52e688b3af9d80&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,null,null,null,0]]"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-l google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----></table-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></div></div><p data-path-to-node="8"><b data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="0">结论：</b> 只要你配好了 Spring 的 Redis 信息（为了给 Lettuce 用），Redisson 就会“蹭”这份配置，自动连接到同一个 Redis 服务。</p><h3 data-path-to-node="9">2. 它们是共用同一个连接吗？(重要概念)</h3><p data-path-to-node="10">虽然它们共用<b data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="6">配置信息</b>，但它们<b data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="14">不共用物理连接</b>。</p><ul data-path-to-node="11"><li><p data-path-to-node="11,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="11,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Lettuce</b> 会建立自己的连接池（基于 Netty）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="11,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="11,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Redisson</b> 也会建立自己独立的连接池（同样基于 Netty，但逻辑不同）。</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="12">这意味着，如果你的 Redis 最大连接数限制很小（比如只有 10 个），通过这种方式启动应用，Lettuce 可能会占 5 个，Redisson 占 5 个。它们是<b data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="83">并列运行</b>的两个独立客户端。</p><h3 data-path-to-node="13">3. 什么时候你需要单独配置 Redisson？</h3><p data-path-to-node="14">虽然“蹭配置”很方便，但 Spring 标准配置只能覆盖最基础的参数（IP、端口、密码）。</p><p data-path-to-node="15">如果你需要调整 Redisson 特有的<b data-path-to-node="15" data-index-in-node="20">高级参数</b>，你就必须单独配置它。</p><p data-path-to-node="16"><b data-path-to-node="16" data-index-in-node="0">场景举例：</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="17"><li><p data-path-to-node="17,0,0">你需要调整 Redisson 的 <b data-path-to-node="17,0,0" data-index-in-node="17">看门狗（Watchdog）默认时间</b>（默认 30秒）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="17,1,0">你需要配置 Redisson 的 <b data-path-to-node="17,1,0" data-index-in-node="17">Codec（编解码器）</b>（例如指定使用 FstCodec 而不是 JSON）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="17,2,0">你需要调整 Redisson 的 <b data-path-to-node="17,2,0" data-index-in-node="17">Netty 线程数</b>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="17,3,0">你需要使用 <b data-path-to-node="17,3,0" data-index-in-node="6">集群模式 (Cluster)</b>，且 Spring 的简单配置无法满足特定的拓扑刷新策略。</p></li></ul><h4 data-path-to-node="18">如何进行单独高级配置？</h4><p data-path-to-node="19">你可以创建一个 <code data-path-to-node="19" data-index-in-node="8">redisson.yaml</code> 文件放在 <code data-path-to-node="19" data-index-in-node="27">resources</code> 目录下，或者在 <code data-path-to-node="19" data-index-in-node="45">application.yml</code> 中指定配置文件路径：</p><p data-path-to-node="20"><b data-path-to-node="20" data-index-in-node="0">步骤 1：修改 application.yml</b></p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-163 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-163 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6c52e688b3af9d80&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_5eb78da5dd4a6f18&quot;,null,null,