</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="16"><b data-path-to-node="16" data-index-in-node="0">配置类调整：</b>
无需额外 Java 代码，<code data-path-to-node="16" data-index-in-node="20">redisson-spring-boot-starter</code> 会检测到 Lettuce 不存在，自动把 <code data-path-to-node="16" data-index-in-node="70">RedisTemplate</code> 的底层工厂替换为 <code data-path-to-node="16" data-index-in-node="93">RedissonConnectionFactory</code>。</p><hr data-path-to-node="17"><h3 data-path-to-node="18">5. 最终结论与建议</h3><div class="horizontal-scroll-wrapper"><div class="table-block-component"><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><table-block _nghost-ng-c3726268734="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" class="table-block has-export-button"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" not-end-of-paragraph="" class="table-content not-end-of-paragraph" jslog="275421;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQ3ecQahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQsAI"><table data-path-to-node="19"><thead><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="19,0,0,0">维度</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="19,0,1,0">混合模式 (Lettuce + Redisson)</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="19,0,2,0">纯 Redisson 模式 (Only Redisson)</span></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="19,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="19,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">推荐指数</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="19,1,1,0">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ (官方推荐)</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="19,1,2,0">⭐⭐⭐</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="19,2,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="19,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">性能</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="19,2,1,0">极高 (各司其职)</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="19,2,2,0">中等 (有封装开销)</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="19,3,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="19,3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">稳定性</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="19,3,1,0">极高 (Spring 官方测试)</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="19,3,2,0">依赖 Redisson 适配层的质量</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="19,4,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="19,4,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">资源消耗</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="19,4,1,0">稍高 (两套连接池)</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="19,4,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="19,4,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">低 (一套连接池)</b></span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="19,5,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="19,5,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">适用场景</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="19,5,1,0">99% 的互联网业务</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="19,5,2,0">连接数极度受限、或为了极简依赖</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" hide-from-message-actions="" class="table-footer hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制表格" aria-label="复制表格" data-test-id="copy-table-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="276666;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_887b8b6e99c8bb28&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,null,null,null,0]]"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-l google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----></table-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></div></div><p data-path-to-node="20"><b data-path-to-node="20" data-index-in-node="0">我的建议：</b></p><p data-path-to-node="21"><b data-path-to-node="21" data-index-in-node="0">不要替换。请保持“混合双打”模式。</b></p><p data-path-to-node="22">让 Lettuce 做它最擅长的脏活累活（海量数据读写），让 Redisson 做它擅长的高级活（分布式锁、复杂集合）。虽然多占用了几个 TCP 连接，但换来的是<b data-path-to-node="22" data-index-in-node="81">系统的稳定性</b>和<b data-path-to-node="22" data-index-in-node="88">最佳的读写性能</b>。毕竟，内存和连接数通常比排查奇怪的适配层 Bug 要便宜得多。</p><hr data-path-to-node="23"><p data-path-to-node="24"><b data-path-to-node="24" data-index-in-node="0">后续</b></p><p data-path-to-node="25">如果你决定保持“混合模式”，但又担心连接数太多，我可以教你<b data-path-to-node="25" data-index-in-node="29">如何优化 Lettuce 和 Redisson 的连接池参数</b>，让它们共存时也不会占用太多资源。需要这方面的配置建议吗？</p></div><!----></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="response-footer is-mobile gap has-thoughts complete"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" _nghost-ng-c1438932748="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3454274491="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c3454274491-165"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c1927598164="" class="ng-tns-c1927598164-171 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c1927598164-171 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" class="spacer ng-tns-c1927598164-171 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c1927598164-171"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c1927598164-171"><!-