66473866-178 is-mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c2166473866-178"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c2166473866-178 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c2166473866-178"><span _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="ng-tns-c2166473866-178">显示思路</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c2166473866-178"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c2166473866-178 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts is-mobile ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c3024867895="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" _nghost-ng-c4114227185="" id="message-content-id-r_c3fc2f9963cb0b64" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4114227185="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_c3fc2f9963cb0b64" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">这是一个非常“刁钻”且容易踩坑的配置场景。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">直接回答你的问题：<b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="9">在这种情况下，RedisTemplate 将不再使用 Lettuce，而是会“被迫”使用 Redisson 作为底层连接。</b></p><p data-path-to-node="2">即使你的 Maven 依赖里有 Lettuce，Spring Boot 的自动配置机制（Auto Configuration）也会让 Redisson 喧宾夺主。</p><p data-path-to-node="3">以下是详细的<b data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="6">原因分析</b>和<b data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="11">如何挽回（如果你想用 Lettuce）</b>：</p><h3 data-path-to-node="4">1. 为什么 Lettuce 会失效？（原理分析）</h3><p data-path-to-node="5">Spring Boot 的自动配置遵循“先到先得”和“条件判断”的原则。</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="6"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">抢占机制 (<code data-path-to-node="6,0,0" data-index-in-node="6">@AutoConfigureBefore</code>)</b>：
<code data-path-to-node="6,0,0" data-index-in-node="29">redisson-spring-boot-starter</code> 中的自动配置类 <code data-path-to-node="6,0,0" data-index-in-node="66">RedissonAutoConfiguration</code> 被设计为在 Spring 原生的 <code data-path-to-node="6,0,0" data-index-in-node="109">RedisAutoConfiguration</code> <b data-path-to-node="6,0,0" data-index-in-node="132">之前</b>执行。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">单一 Bean 原则 (<code data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="12">@ConditionalOnMissingBean</code>)</b>：</p><ul data-path-to-node="6,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,1,1,0,0">Redisson 启动时，会根据你的集群配置创建一个 <code data-path-to-node="6,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="27">RedissonConnectionFactory</code>（实现了 <code data-path-to-node="6,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="57">RedisConnectionFactory</code> 接口）并注入到 Spring 容器中。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,1,1,1,0">等到 Spring 原生的配置类运行时，它会检查：“容器里是不是已经有一个 <code data-path-to-node="6,1,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="38">RedisConnectionFactory</code> 了？”</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,1,1,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,1,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">答案是 Yes（Redisson 刚创建的）。</b></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,1,1,3,0">于是，Spring 原生的 Lettuce 配置就会<b data-path-to-node="6,1,1,3,0" data-index-in-node="26">自动放弃</b>（Back off），不再创建 <code data-path-to-node="6,1,1,3,0" data-index-in-node="46">LettuceConnectionFactory</code>。</p></li></ul></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="7"><b data-path-to-node="7" data-index-in-node="0">结论：</b> 你的 <code data-path-to-node="7" data-index-in-node="7">RedisTemplate</code> 注入的 <code data-path-to-node="7" data-index-in-node="25">ConnectionFactory</code> 变成了 Redisson 的。你以为是混合双打，其实变成了 Redisson 单核带队。</p><h3 data-path-to-node="8">2. 这种情况会有什么后果？</h3><p data-path-to-node="9">正如我们在上一个问题中讨论的，如果 <code data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="18">RedisTemplate</code> 底层变成了 Redisson：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="10"><li><p data-path-to-node="10,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="10,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">性能开销增加</b>：简单的 <code data-path-to-node="10,0,0" data-index-in-node="11">opsForValue().get()</code> 操作也要走一遍 Redisson 复杂的内部逻辑，不如 Lettuce 直接。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="10,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="10,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">配置割裂</b>：你配置了 Redisson 的集群参数，但如果你的 <code data-path-to-node="10,1,0" data-index-in-node="31">application.yml</code> 中还有关于 Lettuce 连接池的配置（如 <code data-path-to-node="10,1,0" data-index-in-node="70">spring.data.redis.lettuce.pool.*</code>），这些参数将<b data-path-to-node="10,1,0" data-index-in-node="109">完全失效</b>，不会起任何作用。</p></li></ol><h3 data-path-to-node="11">3. 我想保留“Lettuce 做读写，Redisson 做锁”，该怎么办？</h3><p data-path-to-node="12">如果你希望维持“混合模式”（Lettuce 负责 <code data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="25">RedisTemplate</code>，Redisson 负责分布式锁），你需要<b data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="59">手动干预</b> Spring 的 Bean 创建过程，显式定义 Lettuce 的连接工厂，从而“顶掉”Redisson 的自动配置。</p><p data-path-to-node="13">你需要在配置类中<b data-path-to-node="13" data-index-in-node="8">手动声明 <code data-path-to-node="13" data-index-in-node="13">LettuceConnectionFactory</code></b>。</p><h4 data-path-to-node="14">解决方案代码：</h4><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-263 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-263 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_c3fc2f9963cb0b64&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_fba3e097f98b28b1&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ_wI" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-263 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-263">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-263 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-263 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_c3fc2f9963cb0b64&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_fba3e097f98b28b1&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-263"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-263"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-263"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-263"><span class="hljs-meta">@Configuration</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title">RedisHybridConfig</span> </span>{

    <span class="hljs-comment">// 1. 显式定义 LettuceConnectionFactory</span>
    <span class="hljs-comment">// 这样做会告诉 Spring："我有自己的连接工厂了，Redisson 你别插手 RedisTemplate 的事"</span>
    <span class="hljs-meta">@Bean</span>
    <span class="hljs-meta">@Primary</span> <span class="hljs-comment">// 标记为主选，防止冲突</span>
    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> RedisConnectionFactory <span class="hljs-title">redisConnectionFactory</span><span class="hljs-params">(RedisProperties redisProperties)</span> </span>{
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 这里手动构建 Lettuce 工厂</span>
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 如果是集群模式，需要在这里解析 redisProperties.getCluster() 并构建配置</span>
        RedisStandaloneConfiguration config = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> RedisStandaloneConfiguration();
        config.setHostName(redisProperties.getHost());
        config.setPort(redisProperties.getPort());
        config.setPassword(RedisPassword.of(redisProperties.getPassword()));
        
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 如果是集群，请用 RedisClusterConfiguration 替代上面的 Standalone</span>
        <span class="hljs-comment">// return new LettuceConnectionFactory(clusterConfig);</span>
        
        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> LettuceConnectionFactory(config);
    }

    <span class="hljs-comment">// 2. RedisTemplate 依然使用上面的 factory</span>
    <span class="hljs-meta">@Bean</span>
    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> RedisTemplate&lt;String, Object&gt; <span class="hljs-title">redisTemplate</span><span class="hljs-params">(RedisConnectionFactory factory)</span> </span>{
        RedisTemplate&lt;String, Object&gt; template = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> RedisTemplate&lt;&gt;();
        template.setConnectionFactory(factory);
        <span class="hljs-comment">// ... 设置序列化 ...</span>
        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> template;
    }
}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="16"><b data-path-to-node="16" data-index-in-node="0">但是在集群模式下，手动写 <code data-path-to-node="16" data-index-in-node="13">LettuceConnectionFactory</code> 的配置代码非常繁琐（要解析节点、拓扑等）。</b></p><h3 data-path-to-node="17">4. 最简单的修正方案（推荐）</h3><p data-path-to-node="18">如果你不想写一大堆 Java 代码来配置 Lettuce，最简单的办法是<b data-path-to-node="18" data-index-in-node="36">利用 Redisson Starter 的配置开关</b>。</p><p data-path-to-node="19"><code data-path-to-node="19" data-index-in-node="0">redisson-spring-boot-starter</code> 通常只在没有定义 ConnectionFactory 时才自动注入。但在某些版本中它非常强势。</p><p data-path-to-node="20">最稳妥的“混合共存”配置法是：<b data-path-to-node="20" data-index-in-node="15">不要在配置文件里写 Redisson 的特有配置，而是让 Redisson 去读取 Spring 的标准配置。</b></p><p data-path-to-node="21"><b data-path-to-node="21" data-index-in-node="0">建议的配置方式：</b></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="22"><li><p data-path-to-node="22,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="22,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">保留 Lettuce 依赖</b>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="22,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="22,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">配置文件只写 Spring 标准配置</b>：</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-264 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-264 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_c3fc2f9963cb0b64&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_fba3e097f98b28b1&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQgAM" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-264 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-264">YAML</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-264 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-264 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_c3fc2f9963cb0b64&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_fba3e097f98b28b1&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-264"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-264"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-264"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-264"><span class="hljs-attr">spring:</span>
