    lock.unlock();
}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 data-path-to-node="8">2. 布隆过滤器 (Bloom Filter) —— <b data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="27">防穿透神器</b></h3><p data-path-to-node="9">布隆过滤器用于判断**“一个元素一定不存在，或者可能存在”**。它占用内存极小，速度极快。</p><ul data-path-to-node="10"><li><p data-path-to-node="10,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="10,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">痛点：</b> 黑客拿不存在的 ID 疯狂攻击（缓存穿透），直接打垮数据库。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="10,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="10,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Redisson 方案：</b> <code data-path-to-node="10,1,0" data-index-in-node="13">RBloomFilter</code>。Redisson 会自动计算 Hash 函数和位图大小。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="10,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="10,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">场景：</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="10,2,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="10,2,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="10,2,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">缓存穿透保护：</b> 查询数据库前，先问布隆过滤器“这 ID 存在吗？”，如果不存在直接返回。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="10,2,1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="10,2,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">去重：</b> 爬虫 URL 去重、每日签到用户去重（数据量巨大时）。</p></li></ul></li></ul><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-287 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-287 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_329d4385bc05af6c&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_3ab4578ee288567e&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQnwM" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-287 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-287">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-287 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-287 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_329d4385bc05af6c&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_3ab4578ee288567e&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-287"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-287"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-287"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-287">RBloomFilter&lt;String&gt; bloomFilter = redissonClient.getBloomFilter(<span class="hljs-string">"user-id-filter"</span>);
<span class="hljs-comment">// 初始化：预计插入1亿条数据，误差率0.03</span>
bloomFilter.tryInit(<span class="hljs-number">100000000L</span>, <span class="hljs-number">0.03</span>);

bloomFilter.add(<span class="hljs-string">"user:1001"</span>);
<span class="hljs-keyword">boolean</span> exists = bloomFilter.contains(<span class="hljs-string">"user:9999"</span>); <span class="hljs-comment">// false</span>
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 data-path-to-node="12">3. 延迟队列 (Delayed Queue) —— <b data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="27">轻量级定时器</b></h3><p data-path-to-node="13">Redis 原生没有延迟队列，通常用 ZSet 的 score 也就是时间戳来实现，但手写很麻烦。</p><ul data-path-to-node="14"><li><p data-path-to-node="14,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="14,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">痛点：</b> 订单下单 30 分钟未支付自动关闭。用 MQ（RabbitMQ/RocketMQ）做死信队列虽然好，但对于简单业务有点重。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="14,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="14,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Redisson 方案：</b> <code data-path-to-node="14,1,0" data-index-in-node="13">RDelayedQueue</code> + <code data-path-to-node="14,1,0" data-index-in-node="29">RBlockingQueue</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="14,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="14,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">场景：</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="14,2,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="14,2,1,0,0">订单超时取消。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="14,2,1,1,0">重试机制（任务失败后，5秒后重试）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="14,2,1,2,0">到点发送提醒通知。</p></li></ul></li></ul><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-288 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-288 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_329d4385bc05af6c&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_3ab4578ee288567e&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQoAM" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-288 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-288">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-288 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-288 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_329d4385bc05af6c&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_3ab4578ee288567e&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-288"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-288"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-288"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-288">RBlockingQueue&lt;String&gt; blockingQueue = redissonClient.getBlockingQueue(<span class="hljs-string">"order-queue"</span>);
RDelayedQueue&lt;String&gt; delayedQueue = redissonClient.getDelayedQueue(blockingQueue);

<span class="hljs-comment">// 30秒后，消息会自动由 delayedQueue 转移到 blockingQueue 中被消费者取走</span>
delayedQueue.offer(<span class="hljs-string">"order:1001"</span>, <span class="hljs-number">30</span>, TimeUnit.SECONDS);
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 data-path-to-node="16">4. 分布式限流 (Rate Limiter) —— <b data-path-to-node="16" data-index-in-node="27">高并发保护</b></h3><p data-path-to-node="17">限制某个接口或用户的访问频率。</p><ul data-path-to-node="18"><li><p data-path-to-node="18,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="18,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">痛点：</b> 也就是通常说的“QPS 限制”。手写 Lua 脚本实现令牌桶算法很复杂。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="18,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="18,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Redisson 方案：</b> <code data-path-to-node="18,1,0" data-index-in-node="13">RRateLimiter</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="18,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="18,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">场景：</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="18,2,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="18,2,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="18,2,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">接口限流：</b> 限制 API 每秒只能被调用 100 次。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="18,2,1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="18,2,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">用户限流：</b> 防止短信接口被刷（限制每个手机号每天发 5 条）。</p></li></ul></li></ul><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-289 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-289 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_329d4385bc05af6c&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_3ab4578ee288567e&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQoQM" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-289 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-289">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-289 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-289 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_329d4385bc05af6c&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_3ab4578ee288567e&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-289"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-289"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-289"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-289">RRateLimiter rateLimiter = redissonClient.getRateLimiter(<span class="hljs-string">"sms:limit:13800000000"</span>);
<span class="hljs-comment">// 设置规则：每 1 秒产生 1 个令牌 (1 QPS)</span>
rateLimiter.trySetRate(RateType.OVERALL, <span class="hljs-number">1</span>, <span class="hljs-number">1</span>, RateTimeUnit.SECONDS);

<span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (rateLimiter.tryAcquire()) {
    <span class="hljs-comment">// 发送短信</span>
} <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> {
    <span class="hljs-comment">// 限流提示</span>
}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 data-path-to-node="20">5. 分布式集合 (Distributed Collections)</h3><p data-path-to-node="21">当你需要在不同机器的 JVM 之间共享一个 List, Map 或 Set 时。</p><ul data-path-to-node="22"><li><p data-path-to-node="22,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="22,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">痛点：</b> 本地 <code data-path-to-node="22,0,0" data-index-in-node="7">HashMap</code> 只能当前 JVM 用，多实例无法共享状态。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="22,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="22,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Redisson 方案：</b> <code data-path-to-node="22,1,0" data-index-in-node="13">RMap</code>, <code data-path-to-node="22,1,0" data-index-in-node="19">RList</code>, <code data-path-to-node="22,1,0" data-index-in-node="26">RSet</code>, <code data-path-to-node="22,1,0" data-index-in-node="32">RScoredSortedSet</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="22,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="22,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">场景：</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="22,2,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="22,2,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="22,2,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">全局 Session 管理：</b> 虽然 Spring Session 也是这原理，但用 RMap 可以更细粒度控制。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="22,2,1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="22,2,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">在线用户列表：</b> 使用 <code data-path-to-node="22,2,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="11">RSet</code> 存储当前在线用户的 ID。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="22,2,1,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="22,2,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">排行榜：</b> 使用 <code data-path-to-node="22,2,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="8">RScoredSortedSet</code> 实时更新游戏分数。</p></li></ul></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node="23">6. 信号量 (Semaphore &amp; CountDownLatch)</h3><p data-path-to-node="24">对应 Java JUC 包下的 <code data-path-to-node="24" data-index-in-node="16">Semaphore</code> 和 <code data-path-to-node="24" data-index-in-node="28">CountDownLatch</code>，但是是<b data-path-to-node="24" data-index-in-node="46">跨 JVM</b> 的。</p><ul data-path-to-node="25"><li><p data-path-to-node="25,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="25,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">场景：</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="25,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="25,0,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="25,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">分布式限流（另一种方式）：</b> <code data-path-to-node="25,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="14">RSemaphore</code>。比如整个系统只允许 3 个线程同时执行某个跑批任务。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="25,0,1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="25,0,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">分布式闭锁：</b> <code data-path-to-node="25,0,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="7">RCountDownLatch</code>。比如主线程要等 5 个分布在不同机器上的子任务都跑完，才能执行汇总操作。</p></li></ul></li></ul><hr data-path-to-node="26"><h3 data-path-to-node="27">总结建议</h3><div class="horizontal-scroll-wrapper"><div class="table-block-component"><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><table-block _nghost-ng-c3726268734="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" class="table-block has-export-button"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" not-end-of-paragraph="" class="table-content not-end-of-paragraph" jslog="275421;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQ3ecQahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQogM"><table data-path-to-node="28"><thead><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="28,0,0,0">场景</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="28,0,1,0">推荐 Redisson 组件</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="28,0,2,0">替代方案 (如果不满 Redisson)</span></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="28,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="28,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">抢单、秒杀、防并发</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="28,1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="28,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">RLock (分布式锁)</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="28,1,2,0">手写 Lua (不推荐，易出错)</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="28,2,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="28,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">缓存穿透</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="28,2,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="28,2,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">RBloomFilter (布隆过滤器)</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="28,2,2,0">Guava (仅限单机), RedisModule</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="28,3,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="28,3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">订单超时取消</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="28,3,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="28,3,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">RDelayedQueue (延迟队列)</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="28,3,2,0">RabbitMQ 死信队列, RocketMQ 延时消息</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="28,4,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="28,4,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">API 限流</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="28,4,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="28,4,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">RRateLimiter (限流器)</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="28,4,2,0">Google Guava (仅限单机), Sentinel</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="28,5,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="28,5,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">排行榜</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="28,5,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="28,5,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">RScoredSortedSet</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="28,5,2,0">RedisTemplate <code data-path-to-node="28,5,2,0" data-index-in-node="14">opsForZSet</code></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" hide-from-message-actions="" class="table-footer hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制表格" aria-label="复制表格" data-test-id="copy-table-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-t