如果你需要**“锁”<b data-path-to-node="29" data-index-in-node="17">或者</b>“复杂的分布式数据结构算法”**，请毫不犹豫地使用 <b data-path-to-node="29" data-index-in-node="45">Redisson</b>。如果是简单的存取字符串，Lettuce 配合 <code data-path-to-node="29" data-index-in-node="77">RedisTemplate</code> 就够了。</p></div><!----></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="response-footer is-mobile gap has-thoughts complete"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" _nghost-ng-c1438932748="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3454274491="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c3454274491-267"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c1927598164="" class="ng-tns-c1927598164-279 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c1927598164-279 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" class="spacer ng-tns-c1927598164-279 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c1927598164-279"><!----></mat-menu><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" yposition="above" class="ng-tns-c1927598164-279"><!----></mat-menu><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></message-actions><!----><!----></div></div><!----></response-container><!----><!----><!----><!----><freemium-rag-disclaimer _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" _nghost-ng-c3728931254="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></freemium-rag-disclaimer><!----></div></model-response><div _ngcontent-ng-c413749340="" class="restart-chat-button-scroll-placeholder ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!-