_ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-content ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-wrapper"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c2166473866="" class="ng-tns-c2166473866-292 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c2166473866-292 is-mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c2166473866-292"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c2166473866-292 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c2166473866-292"><span _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="ng-tns-c2166473866-292">显示思路</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c2166473866-292"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c2166473866-292 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3024867895="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" _nghost-ng-c4114227185="" id="message-content-id-r_d3391cc298f26271" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4114227185="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_d3391cc298f26271" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">Redisson 实现分布式锁的底层原理主要由 <b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="24">Lua 脚本</b>、<b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="31">Hash 数据结构</b>、<b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="41">Watchdog (看门狗) 机制</b> 和 <b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="61">Pub/Sub (发布订阅)</b> 这四大核心要素组成。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">相比于简单的 <code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="7">setnx</code>，Redisson 的实现要复杂得多，主要是为了支持<b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="38">可重入性</b>、<b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="43">自动续期</b>和<b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="48">高效等待</b>。</p><p data-path-to-node="2">以下是详细的原理剖析：</p><hr data-path-to-node="3"><h3 data-path-to-node="4">1. 核心数据结构：Hash (而非 String)</h3><p data-path-to-node="5">普通的 Redis 锁通常使用 String 类型 (<code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="27">set lock:key uuid nx ex 30</code>)。但 Redisson 使用的是 <b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="71">Hash</b> 结构。</p><p data-path-to-node="6"><b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="0">为什么用 Hash？</b>
为了支持 <b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="16">可重入锁 (Reentrant Lock)</b>。
类似于 Java 的 <code data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="50">ReentrantLock</code>，同一个线程可以多次进入同一把锁。Redisson 需要记录“是谁锁的”以及“锁了几次”。</p><p data-path-to-node="7"><b data-path-to-node="7" data-index-in-node="0">Redis 中的结构样子：</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="8"><li><p data-path-to-node="8,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="8,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Key:</b> <code data-path-to-node="8,0,0" data-index-in-node="5">mylock</code> (锁的名称)</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="8,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="8,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Field:</b> <code data-path-to-node="8,1,0" data-index-in-node="7">b4e1...-8801:1</code> (UUID + 线程ID) -&gt; 唯一标识当前持有锁的线程</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="8,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="8,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Value:</b> <code data-path-to-node="8,2,0" data-index-in-node="7">1</code> (计数器) -&gt; 重入次数</p></li></ul><hr data-path-to-node="9"><h3 data-path-to-node="10">2. 加锁机制 (Lua 脚本保证原子性)</h3><p data-path-to-node="11">Redisson 不会发送多条命令（如先 <code data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="21">exists</code> 再 <code data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="30">hset</code>），因为这会有并发安全问题。它将整个加锁逻辑封装在一个 <b data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="62">Lua 脚本</b> 中发送给 Redis，Redis 保证脚本执行的原子性。</p><p data-path-to-node="12"><b data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="0">Lua 脚本的大致逻辑（伪代码）：</b></p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-302 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-302 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_d3391cc298f26271&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_ead5d289b9ce52f3&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQsgM" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-302 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-302">Lua</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-302 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-302 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_d3391cc298f26271&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_ead5d289b9ce52f3&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-302"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-302"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-302"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-302"><span class="hljs-comment">-- KEYS[1]: 锁的名称 (mylock)</span>
<span class="hljs-comment">-- ARGV[1]: 锁的过期时间 (默认30秒)</span>
<span class="hljs-comment">-- ARGV[2]: 客户端唯一标识 (UUID + 线程ID)</span>

<span class="hljs-comment">-- 场景1：锁不存在</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (redis.call(<span class="hljs-string">'exists'</span>, KEYS[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>]) == <span class="hljs-number">0</span>) <span class="hljs-keyword">then</span>
    <span class="hljs-comment">-- 创建 Hash，设置 Count = 1</span>
    redis.call(<span class="hljs-string">'hset'</span>, KEYS[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>], ARGV[<span class="hljs-number">2</span>], <span class="hljs-number">1</span>);
    <span class="hljs-comment">-- 设置过期时间</span>
    redis.call(<span class="hljs-string">'pexpire'</span>, KEYS[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>], ARGV[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>]);
    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-literal">nil</span>; <span class="hljs-comment">-- 加锁成功</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">end</span>;

<span class="hljs-comment">-- 场景2：锁存在，且是我加的 (重入)</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (redis.call(<span class="hljs-string">'hexists'</span>, KEYS[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>], ARGV[<span class="hljs-number">2</span>]) == <span class="hljs-number">1</span>) <span class="hljs-keyword">then</span>
    <span class="hljs-comment">-- 计数器 + 1</span>
    redis.call(<span class="hljs-string">'hincrby'</span>, KEYS[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>], ARGV[<span class="hljs-number">2</span>], <span class="hljs-number">1</span>);
    <span class="hljs-comment">-- 重置过期时间</span>
    redis.call(<span class="hljs-string">'pexpire'</span>, KEYS[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>], ARGV[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>]);
    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-literal">nil</span>; <span class="hljs-comment">-- 加锁成功</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">end</span>;

<span class="hljs-comment">-- 场景3：锁存在，且是别人加的</span>
<span class="hljs-comment">-- 返回锁的剩余存活时间 (TTL)，告诉客户端还要等多久</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> redis.call(<span class="hljs-string">'pttl'</span>, KEYS[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>]);
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><hr data-path-to-node="14"><h3 data-path-to-node="15">3. Watchdog 看门狗机制 (自动续期)</h3><p data-path-to-node="16">这是 Redisson 最核心的特性。防止业务执行时间超过锁的过期时间，导致锁自动释放，从而产生并发安全问题。</p><ul data-path-to-node="17"><li><p data-path-to-node="17,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="17,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">触发条件：</b> 当你调用 <code data-path-to-node="17,0,0" data-index-in-node="11">lock()</code> 或 <code data-path-to-node="17,0,0" data-index-in-node="20">tryLock()</code> <b data-path-to-node="17,0,0" data-index-in-node="30">没有指定 leaseTime</b> 时，看门狗才会生效。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="17,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="17,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">默认配置：</b> <code data-path-to-node="17,1,0" data-index-in-node="6">lockWatchdogTimeout</code> 默认为 30 秒。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="17,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="17,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">工作原理：</b></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="17,2,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="17,2,1,0,0">客户端加锁成功后，后台会启动一个定时任务（基于 Netty 的 <code data-path-to-node="17,2,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="32">HashedWheelTimer</code> 时间轮）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="17,2,1,1,0">每隔 <code data-path-to-node="17,2,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="3">lockWatchdogTimeout / 3</code> (默认 10 秒) 检查一次。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="17,2,1,2,0">如果锁依然存在（即业务还在跑），就通过 Lua 脚本把 Redis 里的锁过期时间<b data-path-to-node="17,2,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="41">重新设回 30 秒</b>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="17,2,1,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="17,2,1,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">死锁防护：</b> 如果客户端机器宕机，后台定时任务挂掉，不再续期。Redis 里的锁会在 30 秒后自动过期，防止死锁。</p></li></ol></li></ul><hr data-path-to-node="18"><h3 data-path-to-node="19">4. 互斥等待机制 (Pub/Sub + Semaphore)</h3><p data-path-to-node="20">当线程 A 持有锁，线程 B 来抢锁失败后，线程 B 不会通过 <code data-path-to-node="20" data-index-in-node="32">while(true)</code> 死循环去轮询 Redis（这样太耗 CPU 和网络）。</p><p data-path-to-node="21"><b data-path-to-node="21" data-index-in-node="0">优化流程：</b></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="22"><li><p data-path-to-node="22,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="22,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">订阅：</b> 线程 B 抢锁失败，Lua 脚本返回锁的剩余时间 (TTL)。线程 B 订阅 Redis 的一个 Channel（频道），名字通常是 <code data-path-to-node="22,0,0" data-index-in-node="71">redisson_lock__channel:{锁名}</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="22,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="22,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">阻塞等待：</b> 线程 B 使用 Java 的 <code data-path-to-node="22,1,0" data-index-in-node="21">Semaphore</code> 阻塞自己，等待时间为 TTL。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="22,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="22,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">唤醒：</b> 当线程 A 业务执行完，调用 <code data-path-to-node="22,2,0" data-index-in-node="19">unlock()</code> 释放锁时，Lua 脚本中会执行 <code data-path-to-node="22,2,0" data-index-in-node="44">PUBLISH</code> 命令发送一条消息。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="22,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="22,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">抢锁：</b> 线程 B 收到消息或等待超时，被唤醒，再次尝试执行 Lua 脚本抢锁。</p></li></ol><hr data-path-to-node="23"><h3 data-path-to-node="24">5. 解锁机制 (Unlock)</h3><p data-path-to-node="25">解锁同样是原子性的 Lua 脚本：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="26"><li><p data-path-to-node="26,0,0">判断当前锁是不是我持有的？不是则报错（防止误删别人的锁）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="26,1,0">如果是，将 Hash 中的计数器减 1。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="26,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="26,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">如果减完后 &gt; 0</b>：说明是重入锁，只刷新过期时间，不删除 Key。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="26,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="26,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">如果减完后 = 0</b>：执行 <code data-path-to-node="26,3,0" data-index-in-node="13">DEL</code> 删除 Key，并 <code data-path-to-node="26,3,0" data-index-in-node="26">PUBLISH</code> 广播解锁消息，通知等待的线程。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="26,4,0"><b data-path-to-node="26,4,0" data-index-in-node="0">关闭看门狗：</b> 客户端取消对应的定时续期任务。</p></li></ol><hr data-path-to-node="27"><h3 data-path-to-node="28">总结：Redisson 分布式锁全流程</h3><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="29"><li><p data-path-to-node="29,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="29,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">尝试加锁</b>：客户端发送 Lua 脚本。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="29,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="29,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">加锁成功</b>：</p><ul data-path-to-node="29,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="29,1,1,0,0">如果是新锁：创建 Hash，Count=1。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="29,1,1,1,0">如果是重入：Count+1。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="29,1,1,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="29,1,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">启动看门狗</b>：每 10 秒续期一次。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="29,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="29,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">加锁失败</b>：</p><ul data-path-to-node="29,2,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="29,2,1,0,0">Lua 返回 TTL。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="29,2,1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="29,2,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">订阅频道</b>，进入 Semaphore 阻塞等待。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="29,2,1,2,0">收到解锁消息后，醒来重试。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="29,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="29,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">释放锁</b>：</p><ul data-path-to-node="29,3,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="29,3,1,0,0">Count-1。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="29,3,1,1,0">归零则 DEL，并<b data-path-to-node="29,3,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="9">发送广播</b>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="29,3,1,2,0">取消看门狗。</p></li></ul></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="30">这就是为什么 Redisson 被称为“企业级”解决方案，它把分布式环境下复杂的<b data-path-to-node="30" data-index-in-node="40">原子性、续期、阻塞唤醒</b>全部封装好了。</p></div><!----></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="response-footer is-mobile gap has-thoughts complete"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2200