2="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-321"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-321"><span class="hljs-comment">// 既然已经配了 Redisson，就直接注入 RedissonClient</span>
