!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="response-content ng-tns-c3454274491-341"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-container"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-content ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-wrapper"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c2166473866="" class="ng-tns-c2166473866-343 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c2166473866-343 is-mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c2166473866-343"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c2166473866-343 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c2166473866-343"><span _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="ng-tns-c2166473866-343">显示思路</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c2166473866-343"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c2166473866-343 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3024867895="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" _nghost-ng-c4114227185="" id="message-content-id-r_6adff8de0d65194e" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4114227185="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_6adff8de0d65194e" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">这是一个非常经典且致命的并发问题，也就是常说的 <b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="24">“误删锁”</b> 问题。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">直接回答你：<b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="6">Redisson 从底层彻底解决了这个问题。即使你的代码写错了，在获取锁失败的情况下强行调用了 <code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="54">unlock()</code>，Redisson 也绝不会允许当前线程去删除别人持有的锁。</b></p><p data-path-to-node="2">它通过以下 <b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="6">3 重机制</b> 来保障安全：</p><h3 data-path-to-node="3">1. 第一重保障：唯一身份标识 (UUID + ThreadId)</h3><p data-path-to-node="4">这是最基础的原理。Redisson 在加锁时，存入 Redis 的 Value <b data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="40">绝不是</b> 一个简单的占位符（比如 "1"），而是一个 <b data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="66">复合字符串</b>。</p><ul data-path-to-node="5"><li><p data-path-to-node="5,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">格式：</b> <code data-path-to-node="5,0,0" data-index-in-node="4">UUID:ThreadID</code></p><ul data-path-to-node="5,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="5,0,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">UUID：</b> Redisson 客户端启动时生成的唯一 ID（代表这台机器/这个客户端实例）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="5,0,1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="5,0,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">ThreadID：</b> 当前执行线程的 ID。</p></li></ul></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="6"><b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="0">这意味着：</b> 每一把锁都清晰地写着“主人”的名字。</p><ul data-path-to-node="7"><li><p data-path-to-node="7,0,0">Thread A 加锁成功，Redis 里存的是 <code data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="25">ClientA:Thread1</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,1,0">Thread B 尝试去解锁，它的身份是 <code data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="21">ClientB:Thread2</code>。</p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node="8">2. 第二重保障：原子性校验 (Lua 脚本)</h3><p data-path-to-node="9">当你调用 <code data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="5">lock.unlock()</code> 时，Redisson <b data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="30">不是</b> 直接发送一条 <code data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="40">DEL</code> 命令给 Redis。</p><p data-path-to-node="10">它发送的是一段 <b data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="8">Lua 脚本</b>。Redis 会原子性地执行这段逻辑：<b data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="33">“先查身份证，再决定删不删”</b>。</p><p data-path-to-node="11"><b data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="0">Redisson 解锁的底层 Lua 脚本逻辑（伪代码）：</b></p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-360 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-360 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6adff8de0d65194e&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_2292904bc5b546f5&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ_wM" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-360 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-360">Lua</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-360 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-360 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6adff8de0d65194e&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_2292904bc5b546f5&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-360"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-360"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-360"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-360"><span class="hljs-comment">-- KEYS[1] = 锁的名字</span>
<span class="hljs-comment">-- ARGV[3] = 当前线程的身份 ID (ClientB:Thread2)</span>

<span class="hljs-comment">-- 1. 判断锁是否存在，并且持有者是不是我自己？</span>
<span class="hljs-comment">-- hexists 命令：查看 Hash 中是否存在这个 ID 的 Key</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (redis.call(<span class="hljs-string">'hexists'</span>, KEYS[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>], ARGV[<span class="hljs-number">3</span>]) == <span class="hljs-number">0</span>) <span class="hljs-keyword">then</span>
    <span class="hljs-comment">-- 如果锁不是我的（或者锁根本不存在）</span>
    <span class="hljs-comment">-- 直接返回 nil，什么都不做！绝对不执行 DEL！</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-literal">nil</span>;
<span class="hljs-keyword">end</span>;

<span class="hljs-comment">-- 2. 只有确认是我的锁，才执行后续的计数减 1 或删除操作</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">local</span> counter = redis.call(<span class="hljs-string">'hincrby'</span>, KEYS[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>], ARGV[<span class="hljs-number">3</span>], <span class="hljs-number">-1</span>);
<span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (counter &gt; <span class="hljs-number">0</span>) <span class="hljs-keyword">then</span>
    <span class="hljs-comment">-- 如果还是重入锁，只刷新过期时间</span>
    redis.call(<span class="hljs-string">'pexpire'</span>, KEYS[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>], ARGV[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>]);
    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;
<span class="hljs-keyword">else</span>
    <span class="hljs-comment">-- 如果减到 0 了，彻底删除锁</span>
    redis.call(<span class="hljs-string">'del'</span>, KEYS[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>]);
    redis.call(<span class="hljs-string">'publish'</span>, KEYS[<span class="hljs-number">2</span>], ARGV[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>]);
    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">1</span>;
<span class="hljs-keyword">end</span>;
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="13"><b data-path-to-node="13" data-index-in-node="0">场景还原：</b></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="14"><li><p data-path-to-node="14,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="14,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Thread A</b> 持有锁。Redis 记录持有者是 <code data-path-to-node="14,0,0" data-index-in-node="26">A</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="14,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="14,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Thread B</b> 获取锁失败，进入 finally 块。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="14,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="14,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">Thread B</b> 错误地调用 <code data-path-to-node="14,2,0" data-index-in-node="15">unlock()</code>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="14,3,0">Lua 脚本在 Redis 端执行：<code data-path-to-node="14,3,0" data-index-in-node="18">hexists mylock B</code>？</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="14,4,0">Redis 回答：<b data-path-to-node="14,4,0" data-index-in-node="9">No</b> (因为持有者是 A)。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="14,5,0">脚本直接返回 <code data-path-to-node="14,5,0" data-index-in-node="7">nil</code>。<b data-path-to-node="14,5,0" data-index-in-node="11">DEL 命令根本没机会执行。</b></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="14,6,0"><b data-path-to-node="14,6,0" data-index-in-node="0">Thread A 的锁安然无恙。</b></p></li></ol><h3 data-path-to-node="15">3. 第三重保障：Java 层面的异常抛出</h3><p data-path-to-node="16">Redisson 是完全遵循 JDK <code data-path-to-node="16" data-index-in-node="19">java.util.concurrent.locks.Lock</code> 规范实现的。</p><p data-path-to-node="17">根据 Java Lock 的规范：<b data-path-to-node="17" data-index-in-node="17">如果当前线程没有持有这把锁，却调用了 <code data-path-to-node="17" data-index-in-node="36">unlock()</code>，必须抛出 <code data-path-to-node="17" data-index-in-node="50">IllegalMonitorStateException</code>。</b></p><p data-path-to-node="18">Redisson 客户端在接收到 Lua 脚本返回的 <code data-path-to-node="18" data-index-in-node="27">nil</code> 后，会意识到：“哎呀，这锁不是我持有的，但我却想解开它”。于是它会在你的 Java 线程里抛出一个异常：</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-361 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-361 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6adff8de0d65194e&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_2292904bc5b546f5&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQgAQ" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-361 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-361">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-361 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-361 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6adff8de0d65194e&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_2292904bc5b546f5&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-361"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-361"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-361"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-361">java.lang.IllegalMonitorStateException: attempt to unlock lock, not locked by current thread by node id: ...
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="20">这不仅保护了 Redis 数据，还提醒了开发者代码逻辑写错了。</p><hr data-path-to-node="21"><h3 data-path-to-node="22">正确的代码写法</h3><p data-path-to-node="23">为了避免那个 <code data-path-to-node="23" data-index-in-node="7">IllegalMonitorStateException</code> 异常干扰你的业务日志，标准的 Redisson 锁写法应该包含一个<b data-path-to-node="23" data-index-in-node="69">判断</b>：</p><p data-path-to-node="24"><b data-path-to-node="24" data-index-in-node="0">写法 A（推荐，标准写法）：</b></p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-362 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-362 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6adff8de0d65194e&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_2292904bc5b546f5&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQgQQ" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-362 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-362">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-362 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-362 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6adff8de0d65194e&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_2292904bc5b546f5&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-362"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-362"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-362"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-362">RLock lock = redissonClient.getLock(<span class="hljs-string">"myLock"</span>);
<span class="hljs-comment">// 尝试加锁</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">boolean</span> isLocked = lock.tryLock(); 

<span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (isLocked) {
    <span class="hljs-keyword">try</span> {
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 执行业务</span>
    } <span class="hljs-keyword">finally</span> {
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 【关键】判断是否持有锁，再释放</span>
        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (lock.isLocked() &amp;&amp; lock.isHeldByCurrentThread()) {
            lock.unlock();
        }
    }
} <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> {
    <span class="hljs-comment">// 获取锁失败的处理逻辑</span>
    System.out.println(<span class="hljs-string">"没抢到锁，放弃或重试"</span>);
}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="26"><b data-path-to-node="26" data-index-in-node="0">写法 B（如果不判断，Redisson 也会兜底）：</b>
即使你写成了下面这样（不推荐），Redisson 依然能保证 <b data-path-to-node="26" data-index-in-node="58">Thread A 的锁不被删掉</b>，只是 Thread B 自己会报个错而已。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-363 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-363 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6adff8de0d65194e&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_2292904bc5b546f5&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQggQ" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-363 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-363">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-363 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-363 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6adff8de0d65194e&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_2292904bc5b546f5&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-363"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-363"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-363"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-363"><span class="hljs-comment">// 错误示范：无论成没成功都 unlock</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">try</span> {
    lock.tryLock();
} <span class="hljs-keyword">finally</span> {
    lock.unlock(); <span class="hljs-comment">// 如果没拿到锁，这行代码会抛异常，但不会误删别人的锁</span>
}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 data-path-to-node="28">总结</h3><p data-path-to-node="29">Redisson 不会发生“误删锁”的情况，因为它：</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="30"><li><p data-path-to-node="30,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="30,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">认人</b>：给每个线程发了唯一的 ID。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="30,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="30,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">严谨</b>：解锁时使用 Lua 脚本<b data-path-to-node="30,1,0" data-index-in-node="15">先校验后删除</b>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="30,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="30,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">规范</b>：如果不属于你的锁，它会抛出异常告诉你代码写得有问题。</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="31">这点比直接使用 <code data-path-to-node="31" data-index-in-node="8">RedisTemplate</code> 手写的 <code data-path-to-node="31" data-index-in-node="26">delete key</code> 要安全无数倍。</p></div><!----></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="response-footer is-mobile gap has-thoughts complete"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" _nghost-ng-c1438932748="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3454274491="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c3454274491-341"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c1927598164="" class="ng-tns-c1927598164-353 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" class="ac