mdc-tooltip-trigger icon-button more-button ng-tns-c3454274491-364 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-31" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3454274491="" role="img" fonticon="more_vert" class="mat-icon notranslate google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="more_vert"></mat-icon><span class="mdc-button__label"></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="response-content ng-tns-c3454274491-364"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-container"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-content ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="thoughts-wrapper"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c2166473866="" class="ng-tns-c2166473866-366 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c2166473866-366 is-mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c2166473866-366"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c2166473866-366 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c2166473866-366"><span _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="ng-tns-c2166473866-366">显示思路</span></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c2166473866-366"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2166473866="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c2166473866-366 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts is-mobile ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c3024867895="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" _nghost-ng-c4114227185="" id="message-content-id-r_6bc1f3646834f1eb" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4114227185="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_6bc1f3646834f1eb" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">配置 Redis 连接池以满足<b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="15">高并发</b>场景，核心在于找到“<b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="28">资源利用率</b>”与“<b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="36">响应速度</b>”的平衡点。</p><p data-path-to-node="1">盲目地将连接数设置得很大（例如 10000）不仅不会提升性能，反而会因为**线程上下文切换（Context Switching）**过多而拖慢系统，甚至导致 Redis 服务端因连接数耗尽而崩溃。</p><p data-path-to-node="2">针对目前主流的 <b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="8">Lettuce</b>（Spring Boot 默认）和老牌的 <b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="36">Jedis</b>，配置策略完全不同。</p><hr data-path-to-node="3"><h3 data-path-to-node="4">1. 核心差异：Lettuce vs Jedis</h3><p data-path-to-node="5">在配置之前，你必须知道你用的是哪个底层客户端：</p><ul data-path-to-node="6"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Lettuce (Spring Boot 默认):</b> 基于 Netty 的 <b data-path-to-node="6,0,0" data-index-in-node="37">NIO (非阻塞)</b> 模式。</p><ul data-path-to-node="6,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,0,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">特点：</b> 单个连接支持<b data-path-to-node="6,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="10">多路复用</b>。这意味着 <b data-path-to-node="6,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="20">1 个连接</b> 就可以处理成千上万的并发请求。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,0,1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,0,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">策略：</b> 连接池不需要很大，主要目的是为了分摊 Netty 的 IO 线程负载。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Jedis:</b> 基于 <b data-path-to-node="6,1,0" data-index-in-node="10">BIO (阻塞)</b> 模式。</p><ul data-path-to-node="6,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="6,1,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">特点：</b> 一个连接在同一时间只能处理一个请求。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="6,1,1,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="6,1,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">策略：</b> 连接池大小通常需要接近你的后端 Web 容器（如 Tomcat）的最大线程数。</p></li></ul></li></ul><hr data-path-to-node="7"><h3 data-path-to-node="8">2. 推荐配置方案 (Spring Boot YAML)</h3><p data-path-to-node="9">以下配置基于 <b data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="7">Apache Commons Pool2</b> 标准。</p><h4 data-path-to-node="10">方案 A：Lettuce (推荐，适用于 90% 的场景)</h4><p data-path-to-node="11">Lettuce 因为支持多路复用，<b data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="17">不需要</b>像 Jedis 那样配置几百个连接。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-380 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-380 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6bc1f3646834f1eb&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_9f3194a7d79e56e6&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQlAQ" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-380 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-380">YAML</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-380 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-380 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6bc1f3646834f1eb&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_9f3194a7d79e56e6&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-380"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-380"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-380"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-380"><span class="hljs-attr">spring:</span>
  <span class="hljs-attr">data:</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">redis:</span>
      <span class="hljs-attr">host:</span> <span class="hljs-number">127.0</span><span class="hljs-number">.0</span><span class="hljs-number">.1</span>
      <span class="hljs-attr">port:</span> <span class="hljs-number">6379</span>
      <span class="hljs-attr">timeout:</span> <span class="hljs-string">2000ms</span> <span class="hljs-comment"># 读写超时，不要设置太长，高并发下快速失败比阻塞好</span>
      <span class="hljs-attr">lettuce:</span>
        <span class="hljs-attr">pool:</span>
          <span class="hljs-comment"># 【最大连接数】</span>
          <span class="hljs-comment"># 对于 Lettuce，通常 CPU核数 * 2 到 CPU核数 * 4 就足够应对极高并发</span>
          <span class="hljs-comment"># 即使设为 16-32，也能轻松抗住上万 QPS。设太大反而浪费资源。</span>
          <span class="hljs-attr">max-active:</span> <span class="hljs-number">32</span> 
          
          <span class="hljs-comment"># 【最大等待时间】</span>
          <span class="hljs-comment"># 当池子空了，业务线程等待获取连接的时间。</span>
          <span class="hljs-comment"># 建议：200ms - 500ms。高并发下，拿不到连接直接报错比让线程卡死强。</span>
          <span class="hljs-attr">max-wait:</span> <span class="hljs-string">500ms</span> 
          
          <span class="hljs-comment"># 【最大空闲连接】</span>
          <span class="hljs-comment"># 建议与 max-active 保持一致，避免连接频繁创建和销毁的开销</span>
          <span class="hljs-attr">max-idle:</span> <span class="hljs-number">32</span>   
          
          <span class="hljs-comment"># 【最小空闲连接】</span>
          <span class="hljs-comment"># 保持一定数量的“温热”连接，防止流量突增时需要新建连接导致抖动</span>
          <span class="hljs-attr">min-idle:</span> <span class="hljs-number">8</span>    
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h4 data-path-to-node="13">方案 B：Jedis (老项目或特定需求)</h4><p data-path-to-node="14">Jedis 是阻塞的，并发能力强依赖于连接数。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-381 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-381 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6bc1f3646834f1eb&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_9f3194a7d79e56e6&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQlQQ" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-381 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-381">YAML</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-381 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-381 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6bc1f3646834f1eb&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_9f3194a7d79e56e6&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-381"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-381"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-381"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-381"><span class="hljs-attr">spring:</span>
  <span class="hljs-attr">data:</span>
    <span class="hljs-attr">redis:</span>
      <span class="hljs-attr">jedis:</span>
        <span class="hljs-attr">pool:</span>
          <span class="hljs-comment"># 【最大连接数】</span>
          <span class="hljs-comment"># 必须设置得比较大！通常建议设为 Tomcat 最大线程数的 1:1 或 0.5:1</span>
          <span class="hljs-comment"># 例如 Tomcat maxThreads=200，这里建议设为 100-200</span>
          <span class="hljs-attr">max-active:</span> <span class="hljs-number">200</span>
          
          <span class="hljs-comment"># 【最大等待时间】</span>
          <span class="hljs-comment"># 同样建议设短一点，快速失败</span>
          <span class="hljs-attr">max-wait:</span> <span class="hljs-string">1000ms</span>
          
          <span class="hljs-comment"># 【最大空闲连接】</span>
          <span class="hljs-comment"># 建议设大一点，比如 50-100，避免高峰期频繁创建连接</span>
          <span class="hljs-attr">max-idle:</span> <span class="hljs-number">100</span>
          
          <span class="hljs-comment"># 【最小空闲连接】</span>
          <span class="hljs-attr">min-idle:</span> <span class="hljs-number">20</span>
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><hr data-path-to-node="16"><h3 data-path-to-node="17">3. 关键参数详解与高并发优化思路</h3><p data-path-to-node="18">为了应对高并发，仅仅复制粘贴上面的代码是不够的，你需要理解以下 4 个关键点：</p><h4 data-path-to-node="19">(1) <code data-path-to-node="19" data-index-in-node="4">max-active</code> (最大连接数)</h4><ul data-path-to-node="20"><li><p data-path-to-node="20,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="20,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">误区：</b> 越大越好。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="20,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="20,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">真相：</b> * <b data-path-to-node="20,1,0" data-index-in-node="6">Lettuce：</b> 设为 <code data-path-to-node="20,1,0" data-index-in-node="18">CPU 核数 * 2 + (1 or 2)</code> 即可。比如 8 核机器，设 20 左右就非常强劲了。因为它的瓶颈通常在网卡或 Redis 服务端，而不是连接数。</p><ul data-path-to-node="20,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="20,1,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="20,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Jedis：</b> 需要参考你的业务 QPS 和 Tomcat 线程数。如果业务平均响应时间是 20ms，那么 1 个连接 1 秒能处理 50 个请求。如果你需要 5000 QPS，理论上需要 100 个连接。</p></li></ul></li></ul><h4 data-path-to-node="21">(2) <code data-path-to-node="21" data-index-in-node="4">max-idle</code> 与 <code data-path-to-node="21" data-index-in-node="15">min-idle</code> (空闲连接)</h4><ul data-path-to-node="22"><li><p data-path-to-node="22,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="22,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">高并发策略：</b> <b data-path-to-node="22,0,0" data-index-in-node="7">预热（Pre-warming）</b>。</p><ul data-path-to-node="22,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="22,0,1,0,0">建议将 <code data-path-to-node="22,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="4">min-idle</code> 设置得稍微大一点（例如 <code data-path-to-node="22,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="25">max-active</code> 的 20%-50%）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="22,0,1,1,0">如果不预热，当突发流量（Flash Sale）到来时，系统需要瞬间创建几十个 TCP 连接，这会产生巨大的延迟（3次握手开销），导致第一波请求超时。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="22,0,1,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="22,0,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">最佳实践：</b> 让 <code data-path-to-node="22,0,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="8">max-idle</code> = <code data-path-to-node="22,0,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="19">max-active</code>。这样连接一旦创建就不会被轻易销毁，虽然多占点内存，但能保证性能最稳定。</p></li></ul></li></ul><h4 data-path-to-node="23">(3) <code data-path-to-node="23" data-index-in-node="4">max-wait</code> (获取连接等待时间)</h4><ul data-path-to-node="24"><li><p data-path-to-node="24,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="24,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">高并发策略：</b> <b data-path-to-node="24,0,0" data-index-in-node="7">Fail Fast (快速失败)</b>。</p><ul data-path-to-node="24,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="24,0,1,0,0">默认值通常是 -1 (无限等待)，这是<b data-path-to-node="24,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="19">生产环境的大忌</b>！</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="24,0,1,1,0">一旦 Redis 变慢，所有 Web 线程都会卡在“等待 Redis 连接”这一步，几秒钟内 Tomcat 线程池就会被占满，导致整个服务（包括不查 Redis 的接口）全部不可用（雪崩效应）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="24,0,1,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="24,0,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">建议：</b> 设置为 200ms - 1000ms。如果 1秒还拿不到连接，说明 Redis 已经挂了或者过载了，直接抛异常降级，保护主线程。</p></li></ul></li></ul><h4 data-path-to-node="25">(4) <code data-path-to-node="25" data-index-in-node="4">timeout</code> (命令执行超时)</h4><ul data-path-to-node="26"><li><p data-path-to-node="26,0,0">这是 socket 的读写超时。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="26,1,0">高并发下，如果 Redis 发生卡顿（比如在做 RDB 或者是大 Key 操作），客户端必须尽快断开。建议设置为 1-2 秒，不要超过 3 秒。</p></li></ul><hr data-path-to-node="27"><h3 data-path-to-node="28">4. 补充：Redisson 的配置</h3><p data-path-to-node="29">既然你之前问过 Redisson，如果你使用 Redisson，它的连接池逻辑又不一样。Redisson 自身管理连接池，通常只需要配置 <code data-path-to-node="29" data-index-in-node="69">connections</code> 大小。</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-382 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block ng-tns-c2283161342-382 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6bc1f3646834f1eb&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_9f3194a7d79e56e6&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQlgQ" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c2283161342-382 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-382">YAML</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="buttons ng-tns-c2283161342-382 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" aria-label="复制代码" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制代码" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c2283161342-382 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6bc1f3646834f1eb&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,&quot;rc_9f3194a7d79e56e6&quot;,null,null,&quot;zh&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c2283161342-382"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c2283161342-382"><pre _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" class="ng-tns-c2283161342-382"><code _ngcontent-ng-c2283161342="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c2283161342-382"><span class="hljs-attr">singleServerConfig:</span>
  <span class="hljs-comment"># 连接池大小</span>
  <span class="hljs-comment"># Redisson 也是基于 Netty 的，所以不需要设太大</span>
  <span class="hljs-comment"># 默认 64，高并发下可以调整为 128-256</span>
  <span class="hljs-attr">connectionPoolSize:</span> <span class="hljs-number">64</span>
  <span class="hljs-comment"># 最小空闲连接</span>
  <span class="hljs-attr">connectionMinimumIdleSize:</span> <span class="hljs-number">24</span>
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 data-path-to-node="31">总结建议</h3><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="32"><li><p data-path-to-node="32,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="32,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">使用 Lettuce</b>：保持默认或小幅调整（Max Active 32-64）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="32,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="32,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">让 Idle = Active</b>：设置 <code data-path-to-node="32,1,0" data-index-in-node="19">max-idle</code> 等于 <code data-path-to-node="32,1,0" data-index-in-node="31">max-active</code>，避免连接忽上忽下。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="32,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="32,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">设置 Max Wait</b>：<b data-path-to-node="32,2,0" data-index-in-node="12">千万不要用默认的 -1</b>，一定要设超时时间（如 500ms）。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="32,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="32,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">监控</b>：配置再好也是理论值。高并发上线前，一定要用 JMX 或 Actuator 监控一下 <code data-path-to-node="32,3,0" data-index-in-node="45">ActiveConnections</code>（活跃连接数）和 <code data-path-to-node="32,3,0" data-index-in-node="71">IdleConnections</code>（空闲连接数）的实际峰值。</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="33"><b data-path-to-node="33" data-index-in-node="0">我可以为你做些什么？</b></p><p data-path-to-node="34">你是否需要一段 <b data-path-to-node="34" data-index-in-node="8">Java 代码（基于 Spring Boot Actuator）来实时监控 Redis 连接池的状态</b>？这样你就能看到当前到底用了多少连接，需不需要扩容。</p></div><!----></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="response-footer is-mobile has-thoughts gap complete"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!