hts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="model-response-text is-mobile ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3024867895="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3024867895="" _nghost-ng-c4114227185="" id="message-content-id-r_faa1aac2e7f55e4a" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c4114227185="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_faa1aac2e7f55e4a" aria-live="polite" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: linear;"><p data-path-to-node="0">简单直接的回答是：<b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="9">数据内容可以是相同的，但“你能看到的数据范围”和“访问数据的方式”发生了本质变化。</b></p><p data-path-to-node="1">如果你把同样的数据（比如 100 万个 Key）分别存在“单机 Redis”和“集群 Redis”中，数据本身没变，但<b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="59">客户端的连接方式决定了你能否完整地访问它们</b>。</p><p data-path-to-node="2">这就好比：</p><ul data-path-to-node="3"><li><p data-path-to-node="3,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">单机连接：</b> 像进入一个<b data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="11">大仓库</b>，所有东西都在这一个房间里，你随便拿。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">集群连接：</b> 像进入一个<b data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="11">连锁超市</b>，东西分散在不同的分店（节点）里。你需要一个“智能导航”（集群客户端）告诉你去哪个分店拿货。</p></li></ul><p data-path-to-node="4">以下是详细的对比和可能遇到的“坑”：</p><h3 data-path-to-node="5">1. 最大的区别：数据分片 (Sharding)</h3><p data-path-to-node="6">这是造成“数据看起来不一样”的根本原因。</p><ul data-path-to-node="7"><li><p data-path-to-node="7,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">单机模式 (Standalone):</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="7,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="7,0,1,0,0">所有 Key 都存在这 <b data-path-to-node="7,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="12">1 台</b> 机器上。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,0,1,1,0">你连接这台机器，能查到 100% 的数据。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">集群模式 (Cluster):</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="7,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="7,1,1,0,0">数据被切分到了 <b data-path-to-node="7,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="8">16384 个槽 (Slots)</b> 中，这些槽分散在多台机器（节点）上。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,1,1,1,0">例如：节点 A 存 0-5000 槽，节点 B 存 5001-10000 槽...</p></li></ul></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node="8">2. 如果用“错”了客户端，会发生什么？</h3><p data-path-to-node="9">这是新手最容易遇到的问题：<b data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="13">服务端是集群，但你用了单机的方式去连。</b></p><h4 data-path-to-node="10">场景一：用“单机模式客户端”连接“Redis 集群”</h4><p data-path-to-node="11">假设你的集群有 3 个节点（A, B, C）。你强行用单机配置（比如 Jedis 直连，或者 Redis Desktop Manager 的普通模式）连接到了 <b data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="80">节点 A</b>。</p><ul data-path-to-node="12"><li><p data-path-to-node="12,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="12,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">你能看到的数据：</b> <b data-path-to-node="12,0,0" data-index-in-node="9">只有 1/3</b>。你只能查到刚好分配在节点 A 上的那些 Key。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="12,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="12,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">你查不到的数据：</b> 如果你查询一个 Key，它算出来的哈希值属于节点 B，节点 A 会告诉你：“这不在我这，去节点 B 找”。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="12,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="12,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">结果：</b> 单机客户端听不懂这句话（它收到一个 <code data-path-to-node="12,2,0" data-index-in-node="22">MOVED</code> 错误），于是直接<b data-path-to-node="12,2,0" data-index-in-node="36">报错</b>。</p><ul data-path-to-node="12,2,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="12,2,1,0,0"><i data-path-to-node="12,2,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">你的感觉是：“数据丢了？”或者“程序坏了？”</i></p></li></ul></li></ul><h4 data-path-to-node="13">场景二：用“集群模式客户端”连接“Redis 集群”</h4><p data-path-to-node="14">客户端知道这是一个集群（配置了 <code data-path-to-node="14" data-index-in-node="16">cluster.nodes</code>）。</p><ul data-path-to-node="15"><li><p data-path-to-node="15,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="15,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">你能看到的数据：</b> <b data-path-to-node="15,0,0" data-index-in-node="9">100%</b>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="15,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="15,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">原理：</b> 当你查 Key 时，客户端会自动计算它在哪个节点，然后自动连过去取。即便发生了数据迁移（MOVED），客户端也会自动跳转。</p><ul data-path-to-node="15,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="15,1,1,0,0"><i data-path-to-node="15,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">你的感觉是：“和单机没区别，所有数据都能查到。”</i></p></li></ul></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node="16">3. 功能上的“阉割” (数据虽在，操作受限)</h3><p data-path-to-node="17">即使你用了集群连接，成功连上了，操作数据的方式也<b data-path-to-node="17" data-index-in-node="24">不再完全一样</b>了。某些在单机上理所当然的操作，在集群里会失效。</p><div class="horizontal-scroll-wrapper"><div class="table-block-component"><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><table-block _nghost-ng-c3726268734="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" class="table-block has-export-button"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" not-end-of-paragraph="" class="table-content not-end-of-paragraph" jslog="275421;track:impression,attention" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQ3ecQahgKEwia5re6k-qRAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQvwQ"><table data-path-to-node="18"><thead><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="18,0,0,0">功能</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="18,0,1,0">单机模式</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="18,0,2,0">集群模式</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="18,0,3,0">影响</span></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="18,1,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="18,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">多 Key 操作</b></span></td><td><p data-path-to-node="18,1,1,0"><code data-path-to-node="18,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">MGET key1 key2 key3</code> </p><br data-path-to-node="18,1,1,1"><p data-path-to-node="18,1,1,2"> <b data-path-to-node="18,1,1,2" data-index-in-node="1">成功</b></p></td><td><span data-path-to-node="18,1,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="18,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">可能失败</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="18,1,3,0">如果 key1 在节点 A，key2 在节点 B，Redis 无法跨机器一次性取回。会报 <code data-path-to-node="18,1,3,0" data-index-in-node="45">CROSSSLOT</code> 错误。</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="18,2,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="18,2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Lua 脚本</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="18,2,1,0">脚本里可以随意操作任何 Key</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="18,2,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="18,2,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">受限</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="18,2,3,0">脚本里涉及的所有 Key 必须在同一个节点上。</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="18,3,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="18,3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">事务 (Multi/Exec)</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="18,3,1,0">支持</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="18,3,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="18,3,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">受限</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="18,3,3,0">同上，事务涉及的 Key 必须在同一个节点。</span></td></tr><tr><td><span data-path-to-node="18,4,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="18,4,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">Keys *</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="18,4,1,0">扫描全库</span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="18,4,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="18,4,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">极慢/不推荐</b></span></td><td><span data-path-to-node="18,4,3,0">需要去每个节点扫一遍再合并，性能灾难。</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" hide-from-message-actions="" class="table-footer hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="复制表格" aria-label="复制表格" data-test-id="copy-table-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="276666;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_faa1aac2e7f55e4a&quot;,&quot;c_1e4fc1c88880f95b&quot;,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,null,null,null,0]]"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3726268734="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-l google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div><!----></table-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element></div></div><h3 data-path-to-node="19">4. 解决方案：如何让集群像单机一样好用？</h3><p data-path-to-node="20">如果你必须在集群里使用 <code data-path-to-node="20" data-index-in-node="12">MGET</code> 或事务，你需要人为控制数据的分布，使用 <b data-path-to-node="20" data-index-in-node="37">Hash Tag</b>。</p><p data-path-to-node="21"><b data-path-to-node="21" data-index-in-node="0">原理：</b> Redis 集群允许你在 Key 中包含 <code data-path-to-node="21" data-index-in-node="25">{}</code>。计算哈希时，只计算 <code data-path-to-node="21" data-index-in-node="38">{}</code> 里的内容。</p><ul data-path-to-node="22"><li><p data-path-to-node="22,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="22,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">不加 Tag：</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="22,0,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="22,0,1,0,0"><code data-path-to-node="22,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">user:100:name</code> -&gt; 存节点 A</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="22,0,1,1,0"><code data-path-to-node="22,0,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">user:100:age</code> -&gt; 存节点 B</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="22,0,1,2,0"><code data-path-to-node="22,0,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">MGET</code> -&gt; <b data-path-to-node="22,0,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="8">报错</b></p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="22,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="22,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">加 Tag：</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="22,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="22,1,1,0,0"><code data-path-to-node="22,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">{user:100}:name</code> -&gt; 存节点 A (只算 user:100)</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="22,1,1,1,0"><code data-path-to-node="22,1,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">{user:100}:age</code>  -&gt; 存节点 A (只算 user:100)</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="22,1,1,2,0"><code data-path-to-node="22,1,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">MGET</code> -&gt; <b data-path-to-node="22,1,1,2,0" data-index-in-node="8">成功</b></p></li></ul></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node="23">总结</h3><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="24"><li><p data-path-to-node="24,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="24,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">数据总量：</b> 如果是同一份数据导入，总量是一样的。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="24,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="24,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">可见性：</b></p><ul data-path-to-node="24,1,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="24,1,1,0,0">用<b data-path-to-node="24,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="1">集群客户端</b>连接：看到的是<b data-path-to-node="24,1,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="13">完整的逻辑数据库</b>。</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="24,1,1,1,0">用<b data-path-to-node="24,1,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="1">单机客户端</b>连接集群节点：只能看到<b data-path-to-node="24,1,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="17">碎片化的数据</b>，且会频发报错。</p></li></ul></li><li><p data-path-to-node="24,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="24,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">使用限制：</b> 集群模式下，<b data-path-to-node="24,2,0" data-index-in-node="12">跨节点的批量操作是不被允许的</b>。</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="25"><b data-path-to-node="25" data-index-in-node="0">建议：</b>
如果在代码中从单机迁移到集群，不仅要改配置（<code data-path-to-node="25" data-index-in-node="26">host</code> -&gt; <code data-path-to-node="25" data-index-in-node="34">cluster.nodes</code>），<b data-path-to-node="25" data-index-in-node="49">务必全面检查所有使用了 <code data-path-to-node="25" data-index-in-node="61">MGET</code>, <code data-path-to-node="25" data-index-in-node="67">MSET</code>, <code data-path-to-node="25" data-index-in-node="73">Lua</code>, <code data-path-to-node="25" data-index-in-node="78">Transaction</code> 的代码</b>，看是否存在跨槽位的风险。</p><hr data-path-to-node="26"><p data-path-to-node="27"><b data-path-to-node="27" data-index-in-node="0">你现在是否遇到了“连上集群后报错 <code data-path-to-node="27" data-index-in-node="17">MOVED</code> 或 <code data-path-to-node="27" data-index-in-node="25">CROSSSLOT</code>” 的问题？</b> 我可以帮你看看具体的错误日志。</p></div><!----></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="response-footer is-mobile gap has-thoughts complete"><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" _nghost-ng-c1438932748="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3454274491="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c3454274491-402"><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c2200210637="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c1927598164="" class="ng-tns-c1927598164-406 ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c1927598164-406 mobile"><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" class="spacer ng-tns-c1927598164-406 ng-star-inserted"></div><!----><!----></div><!----><mat-menu _ngcontent-ng-c1927598164="" yposition="above" xposition="after" class="ng-tns-c1927598164-406"><!----></ma